{"id":"P078-1","subject":"P","unit":"P078","unitTitle":"2025 ① (1월~4월) · 25.04.26 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P078-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.04.26 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01                     ◯원, ◯수\n\n콘덴서의 정전용량 이고, 축적된 전하가\n× C일 때, 콘덴서의 정전에너지J는?\n\n\n\n\n① 200         ② 60\n\n③ 0.32         ④ 0.16","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.26 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p1-e11-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e11-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":527},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e11-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":709}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P078-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.04.26 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02                     ◯원, ◯수\n\n자속밀도가 0.4m인 평등자계 내에서 길이 50cm\n의 직선도체가 자계와 30°의 방향으로 40ms로 이동\n\n할 때, 직선도체에 유도되는 기전력V은?\n\n①         ② \n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.26 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p1-e11-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e11-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":534},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e11-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":757}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P078-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.04.26 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03                     ◯원, ◯수\n\n평