매일경제)","originalId":"2025p1-e11-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e11-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":810},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e11-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P078-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.04.26 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08                     ◯원, ◯수\n\n송전계통의 안정도를 향상시키는 방법으로 옳지 않는 것은?\n\n\n① 중간조상방식을 채용한다.\n\n② 계통을 연계한다.\n\n③ 속응여자방식을 채용한다.\n\n④ 계통의 직렬 리액턴스를 크게한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.26 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p1-e11-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e11-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e11-m08-e1.webp","width":696,"height":881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P078-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.04.26 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09                     ◯원, ◯수\n\n60Hz, 600rpm의 동기전동기에 직결하여 이것을 기동\n\n하기 위한 유도전동기의 극수는?\n\n\n① 8극          ② 10극\n\n③ 12극         ④ 14극","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.26 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p1-e11-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e11-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":470},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e11-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1001},{"src":"data/q